  "title": "CBOR: Add support for CBOR sequence dissection",
  "description": "Per RFC 8742, a CBOR sequence is just a concatenated sequence of CBOR items. This new dissector just processes multiple items (as many as the TVB contains) under one protocol header and identifies it as a \"sequence\". It uses the IANA registration for the media type of RFC 8742.",
